hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1456","Narrated Abu Qatada:\n\nI heard the Prophet (ﷺ) saying, \A good dream is from Allah"""
"1457","Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, When the Day of Resurrection approaches ""1458"",t or.r- said"""
"1458","[AI-translation] Samit, from the Prophet, peace be upon him, who said: ""The dream of a believer is a part of forty-six parts of prophethood.""
"1459","Hisham reported this hadith with the same chain of transmitters. In the hadith transmitted on the authority of Ibn Numair (the words are): She poured water on her sides and in the opening of the shirt at the uppermost part of the chest."" There is no mention of these words:"" It is from the vehemence of the heat of the Hell."" This hadith has been narrated on the authority of Abu Usama with the same chain of transmitters"""""""
"1460","A bedouin came to Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) and said, My wife has delivered a black child."" The Prophet (ﷺ) said to him"""
"1461","I heard the Prophet (ﷺ) saying, Allah said"""
"1462","The hadith of Ibn Abbas: that a man came to the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) and said: ""I saw tonight in a dream a canopy dripping with butter and honey, and I see people scooping from it, some taking much and some taking little. And there was a rope extending from the earth to the heaven, and I saw you take hold of it and ascend. Then another man took hold of it and ascended. Then another man took hold of it and ascended. Then another man took hold of it and it broke, then it was rejoined for him."""" ""Abu Bakr said: """"O Messenger of Allah"", may my father be ransomed for you ""The Prophet (peace be upon him) said: """"You got some right and erred in some."""" He said: """"By Allah"""
"1463","[AI-translation] From Ibn 'Umar, that the Prophet, peace be upon him, said: ""I was shown in a dream that I was brushing my teeth with a siwak. Then two men came to me, one of them older than the other. I handed the siwak to the younger of the two, but it was said to me, 'Give it to the older one.' So I handed it to the older of the two.""
"1464","[AI-translation] From Abu Musa, from the Prophet, peace be upon him, who said: ""I saw in a dream that I was migrating from Makkah to a land with date palms. I thought it was al-Yamamah or Hajar, but behold, it was al-Madinah, Yathrib. And I saw in this dream of mine that I brandished a sword and its upper part broke off. Behold, that was what the believers suffered on the day of Uhud. Then I brandished it again and it became as good as it was. Behold, that was what Allah brought of conquest and the gathering of the believers. And I saw cows in it, and Allah is good. Behold, they were the believers on the day of Uhud, and the good was what Allah brought of good and the reward of truthfulness that Allah gave us after the day of Badr.""
"1465","Musailama-al-Kadhdhab (i.e. the liar) came in the life-time of Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) with many of his people (to Medina) and said, If Muhammad makes me his successor"""
"1466","The Prophet (ﷺ) said, The sign of Belief is to love the Ansar"""
"1467","Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) very often used to ask his companions, Did anyone of you see a dream?"" So dreams would be narrated to him by those whom Allah wished to tell. One morning the Prophet (ﷺ) said"""
